OL,3,GNEWSA'My mother apologised': A
OL,4,Asurvivor's journey after genital
OL,5,Amutilation
OL,6,
OL,7,FSara Kahsai grew up in Sudan but moved
OL,8,Fto Birmingham, England, in 2022 after a
OL,9,Fmarrying a bus driver from the city.
OL,11,FBut as she settled into married life
OL,12,Fand her new home, she was coming to
OL,13,Fterms with a life-changing discovery.
OL,15,FSara realised she was a victim-survivor
OL,16,Fof Female Genital Mutiliation (FGM), a
OL,17,Fprocedure she had endured as a young
OL,18,Fgirl.
OL,20,FShe was floored by the revelation and,
OL,21,Fnot least, the excruciating pain she
OL,22,Fwas now beginning to fully understand.
